                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-brown-800 mb-2">Strengths and Weaknesses of the Weimar Republic</h4>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
                                <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 p-2.5 rounded-xl">
                                    <strong class="text-green-900">Strengths:</strong>
                                    <ul class="list-disc pl-4 mt-1 space-y-1 text-green-900">
                                        <li>Proportional Representation - % of votes = % of seats. This meant that everyone felt that their vote mattered.</li>
                                        <li>Universal suffrage - everyone over 20 could vote.</li>
                                        <li>Term limits on the Chancellor and President stopped anyone taking control for too long.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 p-2.5 rounded-xl">
                                    <strong class="text-red-900">Weaknesses:</strong>
                                    <ul class="list-disc pl-4 mt-1 space-y-1 text-red-900">
                                        <li>Proportional representation led to unstable coalitions.</li>
                                        <li>Hard to make quick decisions due to multiple parties.</li>
                                        <li>Article 48 emergency powers open to abuse by President.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="border-t border-beige-200 pt-3">
